{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20774","headline":"常州孟谏议座上闻韩员外职方贬国子博士有感五首 二 · 卢仝","name":"常州孟谏议座上闻韩员外职方贬国子博士有感五首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"干禄无便佞，宜知黜此身。\n员郎犹小小，国学大频频。\n孤宦心肝直，天王苦死嗔。\n朝廷无谏议，谁是雪韩人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20774.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20774","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}